    <item>
      <title>A Prayer of St. Francis of Assisi</title>
      <link>https://appapappa.com/interests/spirituality/prayers/francis/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 16 Nov 2025 06:51:41 +0530</pubDate>
      <guid>https://appapappa.com/interests/spirituality/prayers/francis/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;simple-prayer-for-peace&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  Simple Prayer for Peace&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#simple-prayer-for-peace&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Lord! Make me an instrument of thy peace -&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Where there is hatred, let me sow love&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Where there is injury, pardon&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Where there is discord, union&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Where there is doubt, faith&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Where there is despair, hope&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Where there is darkness, light&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Where there is sadness, joy.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;O Divine Master! Grant that I may not so much&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Seek to be consoled, as to console&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Ik Onkar</title>
      <link>https://appapappa.com/interests/spirituality/prayers/ik_onkar/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 16 Nov 2025 06:51:41 +0530</pubDate>
      <guid>https://appapappa.com/interests/spirituality/prayers/ik_onkar/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;mool-mantar-from-the-japji-sahib&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  Mool Mantar from the Japji Sahib&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#mool-mantar-from-the-japji-sahib&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;There is One God!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;He is the supreme truth&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;He, the Creator&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Is without fear and without hate&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;He, the Omnipresent,&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Pervades the universe.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;He is not born,&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Nor does he die to be born again.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;By his grace,&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;shalt thou worship him&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Before time itself&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;There was truth!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;When time began to run its course&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
